{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07678","headline":"仲夏归汉南园寄京邑耆旧 · 孟浩然","name":"仲夏归汉南园寄京邑耆旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝读高士传，最嘉陶徵君。\n日耽田园趣，自谓羲皇人。\n予复何爲者，栖栖徒问津。\n中年废丘壑，上国旅风尘。\n忠欲事明主，孝思侍老亲。\n归来当炎夏，耕稼不及春。\n扇枕北窗下，采芝南涧滨。\n因声谢同列，吾慕颍阳真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}